				\begin{document}$$\begin{aligned} & \text{Cholesterol-lowering} \\ & {\text{activity}}\, (\%) = \frac{\text{Cholesterol A}-\text{Cholesterol R}}{\text{Cholesterol A}}*100 \end{aligned}$$\end{document} where cholesterol A and cholesterol R are the absorbance of the cholesterol added and cholesterol recovered at 517 nm, respectively.
